{
  "changelog": "Initial release of infectious-disease-pmph-10edition clinical skills pack:\n\n- Comprehensive skill set covering clinical diagnosis, management, and prevention for viral, bacterial, fungal, and parasitic infections based on the 10th edition of Infectious Diseases by People\u2019s Medical Publishing House.\n- Categorized modules for specific pathogens (e.g., COVID-19, influenza, hepatitis, HIV, tuberculosis, malaria) and syndromes (e.g., severe infections, outbreak management, infection control).\n- Includes workflows for etiology assessment, clinical staging, laboratory diagnosis, antimicrobial and antiviral strategies, complication management, and hospital infection control.\n- Supports both typical and special infection scenarios, including zoonoses, bioterrorism-related pathogens, and management of infections in immunocompromised or special populations.",
